---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Bobby from '../components/Bobby.astro';
---
<Base title="Meet Bobby">
  <h1>Meet Bobby Nut</h1>
  <div class="illus"><Bobby size={220} /></div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Bobby Nut is a young red squirrel who lives high up at the top of our valley, among the tall old pine trees. He is quick, curious and just a little bit forgetful.</p>
    <h2>Things Bobby loves</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Hazelnuts, above all other nuts (acorns come second)</li>
      <li>Leaping from branch to branch without looking down</li>
      <li>Looking at the little house at the bottom of the valley, where a warm light shines in the evening</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Bobby's big plan</h2>
    <p>The top of the valley is windy and the nuts are far apart. Bobby has a plan: to travel all the way down the valley and make a new home near the house where the garden is full of trees. It's a long way for a small squirrel, and he'll meet many friends on the journey.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
